WLM assertion found and fixed
  The first EXPLAIN ANALYZE smoke test exposed a missing T_HybridRecall entry in
  ThreadInstrumentation::allocInstrSlot.  The debug build hit instrument.cpp's
  default assertion while allocating WLM/stream instrumentation.
  The affected test backend left the instance in shutdown; it was stopped with
  gs_ctl immediate, recovered on the same PGDATA, and no database was recreated.
  T_HybridRecall now maps to the "Hybrid Recall" utility operator.  The final
  P3-4 test ran serial and parallel EXPLAIN ANALYZE with
  resource_track_level=operator and produced no assertion.

